<title>DENMARK: Danish shares finish at new all-time closing high.</title>
<headline>Danish shares finish at new all-time closing high.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish share prices closed at an all-time end-of-day high for the second consecutive day on Tuesday in a market overflowing with optimism.</p>
<p>The KFX top-20 index finished the day 0.20 point higher at 123.67, beating Monday's record.</p>
<p>Overall bourse turnover was 745 million crowns. The KFX December future ended the day untraded at 123.65.  </p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
